              }
            },
            "description": "NOTE: warehouseUuid/productId are accepted in this body only to re-validate STK-003's Warehouse/Product uniqueness invariant \u2014 update-stock.service.ts's own UpdateStockInput never actually persists them (see that service's own header comment); only the quantity fields are written. This request supplies the Stock's own current warehouseUuid/productId, which trivially passes the re-validation check."
